; The CiA 401 test device of Cia401PeerTests: one logical device with 16 digital inputs, 16
; digital outputs, 2 analog inputs and 2 analog outputs, as Cia401Device declares it for that
; configuration. The objects in 6000h-67FFh are those of the first slice the device implements,
; with the data type and access CiA 401-1 v3.1.0 clause 8 gives them; the PDO records are the
; default PDOs of CiA 401-1 clauses 6.2.5 to 6.2.8. Cia401PeerTests checks every object in 6000h-67FFh
; against the catalogue and against the device's dictionary, so the file cannot drift from either.

